  <h2>What the public site emphasises (May 2026 snapshot)</h2>
  <p>
    From the landing narrative on <a href="https://kakobuy.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">kakobuy.net</a>, a few themes repeat: a <strong>large curated inventory</strong> of &quot;finds,&quot;
