  <h2>Affiliates, freight, and incentives</h2>
  <p>
    Third-party Kakobuy companions sometimes monetise through <strong>forwarding or logistics affiliates</strong> rather than per-item commissions—Kakobuy.net&apos;s published disclaimers lean that direction.
